^\.git$
^\.gitignore$
# Graphics device left behind by a local test/example run in the source tree. It is
# git-ignored, so only R CMD build would ever have picked it up -- and shipping it to
# CRAN is exactly the kind of stray file a submission gets sent back for.
Rplots\.pdf$
